{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204440","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220444001:0":{"text":"이 녀석, 감히 우리를 속이다니. 간이 배 밖으로 나왔군!","source_cn":"臭小子，敢骗我们，胆子真不小啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E72465C03CEE4EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220444002:0":{"text":"나... 난 당신들과 약속한 적 없어!","source_cn":"我……我根本就没答应过你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB43224C51E3417DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220444003:0":{"text":"네가 그러고도 무사할 줄 알아? 러스트 항에서 빅보스의 심기를 건드린 사람은 전부 바다에 던져 상어의 먹이가 되어야 해!","source_cn":"你敢得罪大老板？在锈锚港，惹了大老板的人，都得被丢进海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE459E9303874457A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220444004:0":{"text":"러스트 항에서 상어 먹이로 이렇게 좋은 걸 주는 줄 몰랐군.","source_cn":"我还真不知道，锈锚港的鲨鱼伙食这么好啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C883AC9A55CFA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220444005:0":{"text":"루카? 너... 뭐, 뭐 하려는 게냐! 이 일은 블러디 로즈와 상관없는 일이야!","source_cn":"卢卡？你……你、你想干什么！这事可跟血薇帮没关系！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F2F093AD40459F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220444006:0":{"text":"내가 밉보여도 바다에 던져 상어 먹이로 쓸 셈인가?","source_cn":"我要是得罪了你，是不是也要被扔到海里当鱼食？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9FC5E54D2603A29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220444007:0":{"text":"그... 그게 무슨 뜻이야. 설마 언더그라운드 복싱 시장에 끼어들겠다는 거냐? 이 바닥도 다 규칙대로 움직이는 건데...","source_cn":"你……你什么意思，想插手黑拳市场？咱们也是要讲规矩的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32BFA709E18005A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220444008:0":{"text":"러스트 항에선 우리 블러디 로즈가 바로 규칙이다!","source_cn":"在锈锚港，我们血薇帮才是规矩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70BB62F49459B188","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220444009:0":{"text":"너! 뭐 하는 거야!!","source_cn":"你！你干什么——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9580A7636B957D01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑拳庄家“大老板”":{"text":"블랙펀치 전당포 “빅 보스”","source":"黑拳庄家“大老板”","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:地下拳手斯坦顿":{"text":"권투 선수 스탠턴","source":"地下拳手斯坦顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:庄家打手首领":{"text":"전당포 경비병 보스","source":"庄家打手首领","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"fl